# Build and Test Commands

**CRITICAL: NEVER use these commands for building or running tests:**
- `npm` — NEVER
- `pnpm` — NEVER
- `node` — NEVER
- `tsx` — NEVER
- `npx` — NEVER

Under NO condition whatsoever, from now until the end of time, use any of the above. Always, always, always and forever throughout all eternity, run `make build` and nothing else for building. For tests, run `make test`.

- **Build**: `make build` (ONLY THIS. EVER.)
- **Test**: `make test`

The Makefile orchestrates the build via `build/build.mts`; use `make` as the single entry point.
